# qurioos-website — no runtime environment variables are required.
#
# This is a fully static Astro site; it builds and runs with no secrets.
# The only external call is the legacy /signup form, which POSTs to a hardcoded
# endpoint (academy.qurioos.com/api/signup-request) — no key involved.
#
# If a future feature needs config, add PUBLIC_* vars here and document them in
# CLAUDE.md › Environment.
